NAME
    gcloud alpha fault-testing experiment-templates - manage Experiment
        Template resources

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud alpha fault-testing experiment-templates COMMAND
        [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    (ALPHA) Manage Experiment Template resources.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     create
        (ALPHA) Create an experiment template.

     delete
        (ALPHA) Delete an experiment template.

     describe
        (ALPHA) Describe a single experiment template.

     list
        (ALPHA) List experiment templates.

     update
        (ALPHA) Update an existing experiment template.

NOTES
    This command is currently in alpha and might change without notice. If this
    command fails with API permission errors despite specifying the correct
    project, you might be trying to access an API with an invitation-only early
    access allowlist.

